This project wraps the following third-party component:

  glsl-parser — A GLSL parser written in C
  Copyright (C) 2025 Nicholas Nesbitt
  Licensed under GNU General Public License v2
  https://github.com/nnesse/glsl-parser

The glsl-parser source is included as a git submodule (glsl-parser/),
pinned to donniet/glsl-parser-flex (https://github.com/donniet/glsl-parser-flex),
a fork of nnesse/glsl-parser that additionally contains a local patch to
glsl.lex fixing numeric-literal lexing (exponent, suffix, and hex forms per
GLSL 4.1.4 / ESSL 3.00 Appendix A). The same change is proposed upstream
to nnesse/glsl-parser.

The compiled WASM binary (glsl-parser.wasm) is a derivative work of
the glsl-parser C library and is distributed under the GPL v2.

The JavaScript wrapper (js/glsl-parser.js), AST utilities
(js/glsl-ast-utils.js), C wrapper (wrapper/wasm_api.c), header shims
(shim/), and minimal library (libmin/) are original works licensed
under the GPL v2.
